{# Info icon whose explanation shows as a tooltip (#1494): admin pages keep explanations out of the visible text. Pass the translated `text`. #}
<span class="text-secondary ms-1" role="img" title="{{ text }}" aria-label="{{ text }}" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"><twig:ux:icon name="tabler:info-circle" width="1em" height="1em" style="vertical-align: -0.125em;" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
